<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND WIN FIRST TEST AGAINST PAKISTAN BY 44 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND WIN FIRST TEST AGAINST PAKISTAN BY 44 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>LAHORE, Pakistan 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand beat Pakistan by 44 runs in the first cricket test on the fourth day on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: New Zealand 155 and 311, Pakistan 191 and 231.</p>
</text>
